   "name": "Shanda",
   "npc": "3595",
   "questID": 97979,
   "race": "Night Elf",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You are born kaldorei--the children of the stars--and have inherited a birthright unlike any other in this world. Elune's grace may illuminate our strengths, helping our strikes hit true, or it may help conceal us just as the moon may eclipse the sun.\r\n\r\nOur Long Vigil after the defense of Mount Hyjal has ended, and we have joined an Alliance of others--which you will meet in due time. For now, you are nestled in the boughs of Teldrassil.\r\n\r\nDemonstrate Mother Moon's gifts, and bask in her blessings.",
   "time": 1791612785,
